            "sid": "DAN 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai tobul erwosit Nebukadinesar, tosodi tonyou atipei, ikirikira, kiŋit ŋikeŋarakinitok keŋ tema, “Pa mono arae ŋikilyok ŋiuni aponi iwon kimasakinae eenen narira a?” Toboŋokis ikes erwosit temasi, “Iyookino ŋun okoe erwosit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimu nabo erwosit tema, “Nai ete ayoŋ ŋikilyok ŋiomwon elosete alokidiŋ arira pa eenen, ido mam neni ewanan anawat kec ka etakakini ekile ŋolo a ŋiomwon esibit emalaika.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toapiya nai Nebukadinesar lopuke ŋolo a ekitet a ŋolo arira akim, kirworik tema, “Sadirak, Mesak ka Abedinego iyes ŋiketiyak ŋulu ka Akuj a ŋina alokidiama nooi, tolomutu kiŋa!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu nai ŋikepukak a ŋakwapin, ŋikapolok a ŋikawoikinitok a ŋakwapin, ŋikawoikinitok a ŋakwapin, ŋikeŋarakinitok a erwosit tocunakinos iwapei, kiŋolikis atemar kebu akim nyenom ŋawat a ŋikilyok a ŋuluuni a ŋul; pa anomit akim ŋitim kec, pa anomit ŋisatyo kec ka amam eure a apuru aneni kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimu nai Nebukadinesar tema, “Kipuroe Akuj a Sadirak, Mesak ka Abedinego, ŋina abu kiyaku emalaika keŋ alakun ŋiketiyak keŋ ŋulu apotu kikinyoma iŋes. Apotu ikes nyiwuapa ŋuna alimunit erwosit ka apotu tojala ŋawat kec, nyecamut akitiyanakin ka akilip neni ka akuj ka ace mati Akuj kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, alimu ayoŋ ŋakiro nu: Ituŋanan daadaŋ, kori ŋakwapin, kori ituŋanan a aŋajep adio, ŋulu iyanyete Akuj a Sadirak, Mesak ka Abedinego, etubutubooryo ŋakejen ka ŋakan ka ituworyo akai keŋ ŋamoru ŋuna etukosi koŋin, anerae emam akuj ace ŋina epedori alakun lopite lo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai erwosit kitopoloo Sadirak, Mesak ka Abedinego anakwap a ŋina a Babilon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
